<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Chii 遠端除錯</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 512 512'%3E%3Crect width='512' height='512' rx='96' fill='%23EC7963'/%3E%3Cpath d='M128 355.157V238.655C128 230.609 135.763 224.842 143.466 227.167L239.466 256.132C244.533 257.661 248 262.329 248 267.621V384.123C248 392.169 240.237 397.935 232.534 395.611L136.534 366.645C131.467 365.117 128 360.449 128 355.157Z' fill='white'/%3E%3Cpath d='M384 355.157V238.655C384 230.609 376.237 224.842 368.534 227.167L272.534 256.132C267.467 257.661 264 262.329 264 267.621V384.123C264 392.169 271.763 397.935 279.466 395.611L375.466 366.645C380.533 365.117 384 360.449 384 355.157Z' fill='white'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='256' cy='162.5' r='60' fill='white'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <style>
    /* 配色、字型、陰影參照南一智慧電子書線上書城 https://reader.nani.com.tw/bookstore */
    :root {
      --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', 'Noto Sans TC',
        'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';
      --brand: #ec7963;
      --brand-nav: #dd7674;
      --text: #212b36;
      --text-secondary: #637381;
      --bg: #fff;
      --card-border: #ccc;
      --card-bg: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 20%, #f4f4f4 80%);
      --header-bg: #fff;
      --header-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(51, 51, 102, 0.5);
      --panel-shadow: 0 0 10px #ccc;
      --link: #315d83;
      --input-line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);
      --row-even: #fdf6f4;
      --row-hover: #fbe6e1;

      /* luna 元件（裝置列表、工具列）讀的變數 */
      --luna-font-family: var(--font);
      --luna-color-primary: var(--brand);
      --luna-color-border: #dfe3e8;
      --luna-color-fill-secondary: #fdf1ee;
      --luna-color-fill: #f9dcd5;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --text: #e8eaed;
        --text-secondary: #9aa0a6;
        --bg: #202124;
        --card-border: #3c4043;
        --card-bg: linear-gradient(90deg, #2a2b2e 20%, #26272a 80%);
        --header-bg: #2a2b2e;
        --header-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        --panel-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        --link: #8ab4f8;
        --input-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
        --row-even: #26272a;
        --row-hover: #3a2c29;

        --luna-color-border: #424242;
        --luna-color-fill-secondary: rgba(236, 121, 99, 0.16);
        --luna-color-fill: rgba(236, 121, 99, 0.28);
      }
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      background-color: var(--bg);
    }
    a {
      color: var(--link);
    }

    /* 頁首：Logo、分頁、版本，跟線上書城一樣是白底加陰影 */
    .site-header {
      background-color: var(--header-bg);
      box-shadow: var(--header-shadow);
    }
    .site-header__inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .brand__mark {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .brand__text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--brand);
    }
    .brand__sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .brand__name {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .nav {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .nav__link {
      position: relative;
      padding: 8px 0 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav__link:hover,
    .nav__link--current {
      color: var(--brand-nav);
    }
    .nav__link:hover::after,
    .nav__link--current::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background-color: var(--brand-nav);
    }
    .version {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* 內容區：線上書城的書單區塊是一整條帶陰影的白底 */
    .page {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 20px 0 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--panel-shadow);
    }
    #container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* 使用步驟：沿用書本卡片的框線、漸層底色 */
    .steps {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 0.2rem;
      background: var(--card-bg);
    }
    .step__no {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: var(--brand);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .step__title {
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .step__desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .section-title {
      margin: 28px 0 4px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* 工具列：篩選欄位改成線上書城下拉選單那種底線樣式 */
    .toolbar.luna-toolbar {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 0;
      background: transparent !important;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .toolbar > div:first-child {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
    .toolbar > div:last-child {
      margin-right: 0;
    }
    .toolbar.luna-toolbar .luna-toolbar-item-input input {
      width: 240px;
      height: 32px;
      margin: 0 12px 0 0;
      padding: 4px 0;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--input-line);
      border-radius: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .toolbar.luna-toolbar .luna-toolbar-item-input input:focus {
      padding-bottom: 3px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand);
    }
    .toolbar.luna-toolbar .luna-toolbar-item-text {
      line-height: 32px;
    }

    /* 裝置列表：每列高度由 luna-data-grid 固定 20px，這裡只改顏色 */
    .targets {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid {
      border-radius: 0.2rem;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid th {
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid .luna-data-grid-data-container tr:nth-child(even) {
      background-color: var(--row-even);
    }
    /* 資料下方補空白的那一列不上底色 */
    .targets.luna-data-grid .luna-data-grid-data-container tr.luna-data-grid-filler-row {
      background-color: transparent;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid .luna-data-grid-data-container .luna-data-grid-node.luna-data-grid-selectable:hover,
    .targets.luna-data-grid .luna-data-grid-data-container .luna-data-grid-node.luna-data-grid-selected {
      background-color: var(--row-hover);
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid:focus .luna-data-grid-node.luna-data-grid-selectable.luna-data-grid-selected {
      background-color: var(--brand);
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid td:last-child a {
      color: var(--brand);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid td:last-child a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .targets.luna-data-grid:focus .luna-data-grid-selected a {
      color: #fff;
    }
    .luna-data-grid img {
      height: 14px;
      width: 14px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin-right: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .site-header__inner {
        padding: 10px 16px;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .brand__mark {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
      }
      .brand__name {
        font-size: 18px;
      }
      .nav {
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 20px;
      }
      .version {
        display: none;
      }
      #container {
        padding: 0 16px;
      }
      .steps {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
      .toolbar.luna-toolbar .luna-toolbar-item-input input {
        width: 140px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="site-header__inner">
      <a class="brand" href="{{basePath}}">
        <svg class="brand__mark" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="512" height="512" fill="#EC7963"/>
          <path d="M128 355.157V238.655C128 230.609 135.763 224.842 143.466 227.167L239.466 256.132C244.533 257.661 248 262.329 248 267.621V384.123C248 392.169 240.237 397.935 232.534 395.611L136.534 366.645C131.467 365.117 128 360.449 128 355.157Z" fill="#fff"/>
          <path d="M384 355.157V238.655C384 230.609 376.237 224.842 368.534 227.167L272.534 256.132C267.467 257.661 264 262.329 264 267.621V384.123C264 392.169 271.763 397.935 279.466 395.611L375.466 366.645C380.533 365.117 384 360.449 384 355.157Z" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="256" cy="162.5" r="60" fill="#fff"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="brand__text">
          <span class="brand__sub">OneBook App</span>
          <span class="brand__name">Chii 遠端除錯</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a class="nav__link nav__link--current" href="{{basePath}}" aria-current="page">連線裝置</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="version">Version: Chii {{version}}</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="page">
    <main id="container">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__no">1</span>
          <div>
            <div class="step__title">開啟 App 的書本頁或登入頁</div>
            <div class="step__desc">要用 Debug build，頁面載完會自動連上這個 server。</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__no">2</span>
          <div>
            <div class="step__title">在下方列表找到裝置</div>
            <div class="step__desc">連上的裝置會自動出現，不用重新整理；可以用標題或網址篩選。</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__no">3</span>
          <div>
            <div class="step__title">點 inspect 開始除錯</div>
            <div class="step__desc">新分頁會開啟 DevTools，可以看 Elements、Console、Network 和畫面預覽。</div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="section-title">連線中的裝置</h2>
      <div class="toolbar"></div>
      <div class="targets"></div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    window.domain = '{{domain}}';
    window.basePath = '{{basePath}}';
  </script>
  <script src="//{{domain}}{{basePath}}index.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
